-#
-#  "aus Teilnehmer*in Daten übernehmen" beside a bank account field: fills
-#  in the participant's address or mail, named in the tooltip; hidden while
-#  there is nothing to take over. Used on the person's edit page
-#  (contactable/_finance_fields) and in the Kontoverbindung form
-#  (person/bank_account/_form), as the field's aside
-#  (Wsjrdp2027::StandardFormBuilder#with_aside); _copy_from_participant_script
-#  makes it work.
-#
-#  Locals: person, kind (:address, :email), target (the field's id)
- value = participant_copy_value(person, kind)
%button.btn.btn-sm.btn-primary.text-nowrap{type: "button", hidden: value.blank?,
  title: t("people.buttons.copy_data_title", value: value),
  data: {copy_from_participant: kind, copy_target: "#" + target, copy_value: value}}
  = t("people.buttons.copy_data")
